---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="journey" class="h-section" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
  <div class="h-grid">
    <p class="h-label">Journey</p>
    <div class="journey">
      <h2 id="journey-title" class="h-title">From infrastructure to AI platforms.</h2>
      <p class="story">I started in full-stack and cloud engineering in 2019, building with React, Node.js, and MySQL before moving into senior DevOps roles. My work has included cloud migrations, Kubernetes platforms, secure CI/CD, technical leadership, and automated MLOps and LLMOps pipelines. That experience now informs my focus on the infrastructure and operations behind AI systems.</p>
      <ol class="path" aria-label="Career path">
        <li><span>2019</span>Full-stack &amp; cloud</li>
        <li><span>2020</span>Senior DevOps</li>
        <li><span>2023</span>Azure &amp; DevSecOps</li>
        <li class="now"><span>Now</span>AI platforms</li>
      </ol>
      <a href="/experience/" class="text-link">Read my professional background <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 64ch; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--slate); }
  .path { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 36px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .path li { position: relative; padding: 18px 16px 0 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; }
  .path li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -5px; left: 0; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .path li.now::before { background: var(--signal); border-color: var(--signal); }
  .path span { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font: 400 12px/1.5 var(--font-utility); color: var(--slate); }
  .path li.now span { color: var(--signal); }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .path { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; row-gap: 24px; }
  }
</style>
